# Options of the XiaoTai contacts module. Each maps to the macro of the same
# name without the CONFIG_ prefix in include/xiaotai/modules/contacts_config.h;
# the defaults here and there are the same.
menu "XiaoTai contacts module"

    config XIAOTAI_CONTACT_KINDS_MAX
        int "Contact kinds the registry holds"
        range 1 16
        default 4
        help
            Each call module registers the kind of contact it dials.
            Registering more is an error at init, so the start fails instead
            of silently skipping a kind's contacts.

    config XIAOTAI_CONTACTS_FETCH_NEEDS_PROFILE
        bool "Every contacts fetch waits for an accepted device profile"
        default n
        help
            Off: once the platform is online a requested fetch (refresh,
            signal, page change) is sent at once, and the profile only decides
            when the first automatic fetch of a session happens. On: every
            fetch waits until the profile was accepted in the present session,
            as the deployed firmware of some products does.

endmenu
